     99.38%      91.3%      83.6%   0.0459\n  Ensemble              97.13%     99.82%      89.2%      76.9%   0.0783\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n  Outputs saved:\n    salinas_confidence_maps.png\n    salinas_reliability_diagrams.png\n    salinas_ensemble_error_conf_map.png\n    salinas_threshold_sweep.png\n    salinas_per_class_confidence.png\n    salinas_threshold_conf_maps.png\n\n✅  Block 12C — Confidence Map Evaluation complete.\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":57},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"<div style=\"\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(20,30,48,0.9), rgba(36,59,85,0.9));\n    padding:26px;\n    border-radius:18px;\n    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\n    font-family:'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n    box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\n    color:#EAF2FF;\n\">\n\n<h2 style=\"\n    margin-top:0;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #38bdf8, #a78bfa);\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n\">\n📊 Explainable AI (XAI) — Hyperspectral Models\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"font-size:15px; color:#C9D6FF;\">\n<b>Block 13:</b> Captum-based explainability pipeline for hyperspectral models  \n(No SHAP/LIME dependency, fully Colab-compatible)\n</p>\n\n<hr style=\"border:0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#22c55e;\">🔧 Setup & Libraries</h3>\n\n<div style=\"\nbackground: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\npadding:12px;\nborder-radius:10px;\nborder:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\nfont-size:14px;\n\">\n• Captum → IG, GradCAM, DeepLift, Occlusion, NoiseTunnel<br>\n• scikit-image → resize<br>\n• scipy → smoothing<br>\n• matplotlib / seaborn → visualization<br><br>\n✔ No dependency conflicts<br>\n✔ Pure PyTorch pipeline\n</div>\n\n<hr style=\"border:0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); margin-top:18px;\">\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#a78bfa;\">🧠 XAI Methods</h3>\n\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;margin-top:10px;\">\n\n<tr style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\">\n<th style=\"padding:10px;text-align:left;\">Method</th>\n<th style=\"padding:10px;text-align:left;\">Purpose</th>\n<th style=\"padding:10px;text-align:left;\">Output</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;\">🔥 GradCAM</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;\">Spatial attention heatmaps</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;color:#38bdf8;\">xai_gradcam.png</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\">\n<td style=\"padding:10px;\">🌈 Integrated Gradients</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;\">Spectral band importance</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;color:#a78bfa;\">IG + Global plots</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;\">🧩 Occlusion</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;\">Sensitivity via masking</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;color:#facc15;\">xai_occlusion.png</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\">\n<td style=\"padding:10px;\">⚡ DeepLIFT</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;\">Fast attribution (Shapley-like)</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;color:#06d6a0;\">xai_deeplift.png</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;\">🌫 SmoothGrad</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;\">Noise-stabilized saliency</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;color:#4cc9f0;\">xai_smoothgrad.png</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\">\n<td style=\"padding:10px;\">🗺 Scene Map</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;\">Full-scene attribution</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;color:#72efdd;\">xai_scene_dashboard.png</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;\">📊 Class Summary</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;\">Top spectral bands per class</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;color:#ff9f9f;\">xai_class_heatmap.png</td>\n</tr>\n\n</table>\n\n<hr style=\"border:0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); margin-top:20px;\">\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#facc15;\">🚀 Execution Pipeline</h3>\n\n<ul style=\"line-height:1.7; font-size:14px;\">\n<li>1️⃣ Select best model (highest OA)</li>\n<li>2️⃣ GradCAM visualization</li>\n<li>3️⃣ Integrated Gradients (spectral analysis)</li>\n<li>4️⃣ Global band importance</li>\n<li>5️⃣ Occlusion sensitivity</li>\n<li>6️⃣ DeepLIFT attribution</li>\n<li>7️⃣ SmoothGrad saliency</li>\n<li>8️⃣ Full-scene attribution map</li>\n<li>9️⃣ Per-class summary</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr style=\"border:0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); margin-top:20px;\">\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#ff6b6b;\">⚠️ Key Challenges</h3>\n\n<ul style=\"line-height:1.7; font-size:14px;\">\n<li>🌈 <b>Spectral Complexity</b> — High-dimensional wavelength space</li>\n<li>🧠 <b>Model Interpretability</b> — Deep models are black-box</li>\n<li>🔄 <b>Domain Shift</b> — Different datasets have different distributions</li>\n<li>⚡ <b>Computation Cost</b> — Attribution methods are expensive</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div style=\"\nmargin-top:18px;\npadding:14px;\nborder-radius:12px;\nbackground: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(56,189,248,0.1), rgba(167,139,250,0.1));\nborder-left:4px solid #38bdf8;\nfont-size:13px;\ncolor:#D6E4FF;\n\">\n💡 <b>Insight:</b> Combining multiple XAI methods provides both \n<b>spatial (where)</b> and <b>spectral (what)</b> understanding, \nleading to more reliable hyperspectral model interpretation.\n</div>\n\n</div>","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"# ── FIXES for Block 13 (Salinas XAI) — drop-in replacements ──────────────────\n\n# ── FIX 1: GradCAM layer map — handles adapted models robustly ───────────────\ndef get_gradcam_layer(model_name, mdl):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the last Conv2d in the SPATIAL branch of each model.\n    Works on both original and MMD-adapted (deepcopy) versions.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Strategy A: named attribute path per architecture\n    try:\n        if model_name in ('HVT',):\n            return mdl.spatial_cnn.block3[0]\n        elif model_name == 'ResNetHSI':\n            return list(mdl.layer3.children())[-1].conv2\n        elif model_name == 'DBAN':\n            # spat_branch exists in both original and adapted DBAN\n            return mdl.spat_branch.block2[0]\n        elif model_name == 'MobileHSI':\n            return mdl.features[-1][0]\n        elif model_name == 'HGCN':\n            # spatial is nn.Sequential; find last Conv2d in it\n            last = None\n            for m in mdl.spatial:\n                if isinstance(m, nn.Conv2d): last = m\n            return last\n        elif model_name == 'SpectralMamba':\n            last = None\n            for m in mdl.spatial_cnn:\n                if isinstance(m, nn.Conv2d): last = m\n            return last\n    except AttributeError:\n        pass\n\n    # Strategy B: universal fallback — last Conv2d anywhere in model\n    print(f\"  ℹ️  Using fallback Conv2d scan for {model_name}\")\n    last_conv = None\n    for m in mdl.modules():\n        if isinstance(m, nn.Conv2d):\n            last_conv = m\n    return last_conv\n\n\n# ── FIX 2: Replace DeepLift with GradientShap (no Sigmoid restriction) ────────\ndef compute_deeplift_attrs(mdl, X_batch, y_batch):\n    \"\"\"\n    GradientShap replaces DeepLift — identical purpose, no Sigmoid constraint.\n    Works on ANY architecture including those with SE/Sigmoid gates.\n    Returns (N, B) band attributions.\n    \"\"\"\n    from captum.attr import GradientShap\n    mdl.eval()\n    try:\n        gs       = GradientShap(mdl)\n        baseline = torch.zeros_like(X_batch).to(DEVICE)\n        attrs    = gs.attribute(\n            X_batch.to(DEVICE),\n            baselines=baseline,\n            target=y_batch.to(DEVICE),\n            n_samples=10,\n            stdevs=0.1\n        )\n        return attrs.abs().mean(dim=(2,3)).cpu().detach().numpy()   # (N, B)\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"  GradientShap error: {e} — falling back to IG\")\n        # Final fallback: plain Integrated Gradients\n        try:\n            ig    = IntegratedGradients(mdl)\n            bl    = torch.zeros_like(X_batch).to(DEVICE)\n            attrs = ig.attribute(X_batch.to(DEVICE),\n                                 baselines=bl,\n                                 target=y_batch.to(DEVICE),\n                                 n_steps=20,\n                                 return_convergence_delta=False)\n            return attrs.abs().mean(dim=(2,3)).cpu().detach().numpy()\n        except Exception as e2:\n            print(f\"  IG fallback also failed: {e2}\")\n            return np.zeros((len(X_batch), X_batch.shape[1]))\n\n\n# ── FIX 3: Updated plot_deeplift_summary using new compute fn ─────────────────\ndef plot_deeplift_summary(mdl, model_name, sal_eval_ds,\n                           wavelengths_clean, SAL_NAMES, n_classes=8):\n    \"\"\"Now uses GradientShap under the hood — label kept for consistency.\"\"\"\n    class_ids = list(range(min(n_classes, N_SAL)))\n    X, y      = get_sample_patches(sal_eval_ds, class_ids, n_per_class=5)\n    attrs     = compute_deeplift_attrs(mdl, X, y)          # ← fixed fn\n\n    fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 4, figsize=(20, 9))\n    fig.suptitle(\n        f\"GradientShap Spectral Attribution — {model_name}\",\n        fontsize=13, fontweight='bold')\n    axes = axes.flatten()\n\n    wl = wavelengths_clean[:attrs.shape[1]]\n\n    for i, cid in enumerate(class_ids[:8]):\n        mask = (y.cpu() == cid).numpy()\n        if mask.sum() == 0:\n            axes[i].axis('off'); continue\n        sv   = attrs[mask].mean(axis=0)\n        cols = plt.cm.RdYlGn(safe_normalise(np.abs(sv)))\n\n        axes[i].bar(wl, np.abs(sv), width=12,\n                    color=cols, edgecolor='none', alpha=0.85)\n\n        top3 = np.argsort(np.abs(sv))[-3:]\n        for t in top3:\n            axes[i].annotate(f\"{wl[t]:.0f}nm\",\n                             (wl[t], np.abs(sv[t])),\n                             textcoords='offset points',\n                             xytext=(0,4), fontsize=6,\n                             ha='center', color='red')\n\n        axes[i].set_title(SAL_NAMES.get(cid+1, str(cid)),\n                          fontsize=8, fontweight='bold')\n        axes[i].set_xlabel(\"Wavelength (nm)\", fontsize=7)\n        axes[i].set_ylabel(\"|Attribution|\", fontsize=7)\n        axes[i].grid(alpha=0.25)\n\n    plt.tight_layout()\n    plt.savefig('/kaggle/working/xai_gradienshap.png',\n                dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')\n    plt.show()\n\n\n# ── RE-RUN from [1/7] with all fixes applied ──────────────────────────────────\nbest_name = max(adaptation_results,\n                key=lambda n: adaptation_results[n]['final_oa'])\nbest_mdl  = adaptation_results[best_name]['adapted_model']\n\nprint(f\"\\n{'═'*60}\")\nprint(f\"  XAI target : {best_name}\")\nprint(f\"  Adapted OA : {adaptation_results[best_name]['final_oa']*100:.2f}%\")\nprint(f\"{'═'*60}\")\n\n# Pre-flight\nlayer = get_gradcam_layer(best_name, best_mdl)\nprint(f\"  GradCAM layer → {layer}\\n\")\n\nprint(\"[1/7] GradCAM …\")\nplot_gradcam_grid(best_mdl, best_name, sal_eval_ds,\n                  SAL_NAMES, SAL_COLORS, n_classes=6)\n\nprint(\"\\n[2/7] Integrated Gradients (per-class) …\")\nplot_spectral_attribution(best_mdl, best_name, sal_eval_ds,\n                           wavelengths_clean, SAL_NAMES, n_classes=6)\n\nprint(\"\\n[3/7] Global Band Importance …\")\nplot_global_band_importance(best_mdl, best_name,\n                             sal_eval_ds, wavelengths_clean, SAL_NAMES)\n\nprint(\"\\n[4/7] Occlusion Sensitivity …\")\nplot_occlusion_maps(best_mdl, best_name, sal_eval_ds,\n                    SAL_NAMES, n_classes=4)\n\nprint(\"\\n[5/7] GradientShap Attribution …\")\nplot_deeplift_summary(best_mdl, best_name, sal_eval_ds,\n                       wavelengths_clean, SAL_NAMES, n_classes=8)\n\nprint(\"\\n[6/7] SmoothGrad Saliency …\")\nplot_smoothgrad(best_mdl, best_name, sal_eval_ds, SAL_NAMES, n_classes=4)\n\nprint(\"\\n[7/7] Full-scene XAI Dashboard …\")\nattr_map = compute_scene_attribution_map(\n    best_mdl, sal_data_norm, sal_coords, best_name, batch_size=64)\nplot_scene_xai_dashboard(sal_labels, sal_pred_map, sal_conf_map,\n                          attr_map, best_name, SAL_COLORS, N_SAL)\n\nprint(\"\\n[+] Per-class Summary Table …\")\nplot_xai_class_summary(best_mdl, best_name, sal_eval_ds,\n                        wavelengths_clean, SAL_NAMES)\n\nprint(\"\\n✅  Block 13 — XAI complete.\")","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-04-19T14:32:41.843403Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-04-19T14:32:41.843719Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-04-19T14:32:41.867188Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-04-19T14:32:41.843689Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-04-19T14:32:41.866247Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n  XAI target : DBAN\n  Adapted OA : 96.95%\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n  GradCAM layer → Conv2d(128, 128, kernel_size=(3, 3), stride=(1, 1), padding=(1, 1))\n\n[1/7] GradCAM …\n","output_type":"stream"},{"traceback":["\u001b[0;31m---------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m","\u001b[0;31mNameError\u001b[0m                                 Traceback (most recent call last)","\u001b[0;32m/tmp/ipykernel_55/1735287420.py\u001b[0m in \u001b[0;36m<cell line: 0>\u001b[0;34m()\u001b[0m\n\u001b[1;32m    139\u001b[0m \u001b[0;34m\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\n\u001b[1;32m    140\u001b[0m \u001b[0mprint\u001b[0m\u001b[0;34m(\u001b[0m\u001b[0;34m\"[1/7] GradCAM …\"\u001b[0m\u001b[0;34m)\u001b[0m\u001b[0;34m\u001b[0m\u001b[0;34m\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\n\u001b[0;32m--> 141\u001b[0;31m plot_gradcam_grid(best_mdl, best_name, sal_eval_ds,\n\u001b[0m\u001b[1;32m    142\u001b[0m                   SAL_NAMES, SAL_COLORS, n_classes=6)\n\u001b[1;32m    143\u001b[0m \u001b[0;34m\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\n","\u001b[0;31mNameError\u001b[0m: name 'plot_gradcam_grid' is not defined"],"ename":"NameError","evalue":"name 'plot_gradcam_grid' is not defined","output_type":"error"}],"execution_count":55}]}